# Opt-in Apple A1082 caller preset for Eicon on the verified working line.
# V.22bis inherently limits the carrier to 2400 bit/s.
# V.250 Table 20 / V.42 8.10: start LAPM directly and require LAPM.
# Unknown/non-LAPM peers may fail rather than falling back to raw data.
# No dial/answer command, gain change, protection change, or timer override.
AT+MS=V22B,0
AT+ES=2,3,5
